cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this reanalysis, please cite it as below."
title: "cgc-cfe-reanalysis: Reanalysis of the DARPA Cyber Grand Challenge Final Event archive"
authors:
  - family-names: Wright
    given-names: Jason L.
    affiliation: Idaho State University
repository-code: "https://github.com/wrigjl/cgc-cfe-reanalysis"
abstract: >-
  Scripts and per-challenge-binary results reanalyzing the DARPA Cyber
  Grand Challenge Final Event (CFE) archive: per-round exploitation
  outcomes cross-referenced against each challenge binary's CWE
  classification, with enabled-window timing analysis. Supports the
  empirical claims in Wright, "The Cognition Gap: What the Cyber Grand
  Challenge Revealed About Autonomous Cyber Reasoning" (IEEE Security &
  Privacy magazine).
keywords:
  - Cyber Grand Challenge
  - vulnerability analysis
  - autonomous cyber reasoning
  - CWE
